# The ruling of Opalescence and Humility (2006-02-01): "With a Humility and two Opalescences on the battlefield, if
# Humility has the latest timestamp, then all creatures are 1/1 with no abilities." Two Opalescences (turns 1 and 3),
# then Humility (turn 5): each Opalescence animates the other (on turn 3 both are 4/4) and Humility; in layer 7b both
# Opalescences' parts apply first and Humility's 1/1 last.

